Right now, the issue is not logic, it is page structure + linking.
I’ll show you exactly what pages to create, what to put inside, and how they connect.

Follow this step-by-step. Don’t skip anything.


---

✅ STEP 1: CREATE THESE FILES (VERY IMPORTANT)

In your project folder, create exactly these HTML files:

index.html
admin-login.html
user-login.html
admin-dashboard.html
user-dashboard.html

If even one file name is wrong, login will not work.


---

✅ STEP 2: MAIN ENTRY PAGE (index.html)

This page lets you choose Admin or User login.

📄 index.html

